cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "HOPNET"
abstract: >-
  HOPNET (Wang, 2007) as a standalone swarm routing protocol for MANETs:
  ant-colony routing over routing zones, proactive inside a zone and reactive
  between zones. Planned as a simulator-agnostic C++ core and an ns-3 contrib
  module on swarm-core.
type: software
authors:
